   "html_text": "Daoism sees language as continuous with maps, cairns, blazing trees etc. The use of pictographs and words emerges naturally in this socially cooperative species. Creature vocalization, found elsewhere, we recruit in training, practicing, planning and shared decision procedures. Modern Daoists would acknowledge the role of sentences, syntax and logic in this process and the surprising discovery that human model emulation values accuracy of mimicry over achieving an outcome. Hence our tendency to ",
